<section class="section has-text-centered">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="has-text-weight-bold is-size-1 is-size-3-mobile is-uppercase">Red Bull</p>
    <p class="projectdescription is-size-5">
   In our debut year with Red Bull Racing, we brought Formula 1 fever straight to Miami. Fans got closer than ever to the action with immersive trackside experiences and the reveal of fresh, head-turning car liveries. And with Max Verstappen proving once again why he’s the best driver in the world, the Miami Grand Prix became more than just a race—it was a cultural moment. The result? A city electrified and a new generation of fans hooked on the high-octane pairing of Red Bull and F1.    <p class="has-text-weight-bold is-size-4">Collaborators:</p>
    <p class="collabnames is-family-secondary has-text-weight-bold is-size-4 is-italic">Jason Fisher // Nick Billings // Keirstin Fernandes</p>
  </div>
</section>

